+//AI(W906-W188) 20261009 (NB2-1): W-188 #5 -- ReconcilePickFromHPList = golden 913 ainarm_SearchPickPlate.cpp:1481-1636 (RogerYang 20260827).
+//   This TU sees only the zero-data uPlateInfo facade (aHotPlateSubstrate.h), so the entry point keeps golden :1487-1488
+//   and :1494-1506 (NULL check + busy gate) verbatim here, and the two ledger passes (golden :1489-1492 locals + :1508-1635)
